	(text "DATA TOGGLES, INPUT, RUN AND LOAD, AND THE RESET BUTTON'S BOOT RESET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56c1ecbb-a9a9-5f49-9527-14b290aa37eb"))
	(text "SW1-SW8 switch SW0-SW7 to +5V through RN2 (1k) or leave them open (the IO card's RN3 pulls them down). SW11 INPUT\ngrounds INPUT_L (the IO card debounces it). SW9 RUN/RESET grounds -RESET, SW10 LOAD grounds -PAUSE: the bus lines,\nopen collector. SW12 RESET, debounced by R7 / C1 and U7D: U10A and U10B (74HC03, open drain) pull -RESET and -DMAIN\nlow together, a boot reset: the CPU card clears LOADED and the machine starts in the EPROM. Not while -PAUSE is low\n(PAUSE_N): -DMAIN low in LOAD mode would be a DMA request." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c6962733-e266-5ed7-8a75-91a973d32981"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
